flowchart TB
  goal([Goal or vision doc])
  subgraph design [super-design]
    bs[Brainstorm a spec] --> ka[Name key abstractions] --> dec[Decompose into tasks]
    dec -. task too big .-> bs
    dec --> cov[Check tree against goal]
  end
  goal --> bs
  cov --> rd{{super-roast: design}}
  rd -- findings --> sb1[Step back or fix] --> rd
  rd -- clean --> code[super-code: parallel tasks<br/>plan → implement → review → merge]
  code --> rc{{super-roast: code}}
  rc -- findings --> sb2[Step back or fix] --> code
  rc -- clean --> rep[Report]
  rep --> fin([You choose: merge, PR or keep])
